# "A +1/+1 counter on each creature you control": every creature, a summoning-sick one included, and no noncreature
# artifact. On turn one two Ornithopters and four Moxen are out (all free), and the Township's ability gives each Ornithopter
# a counter and the Moxen none. It is used again on turn three: the counters accumulate, two on each.

